### 1. Start the login (open in a browser: redirects to the mock mObywatel page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/mobywatel/authorize?redirect_uri=http://localhost:8765/&state=demo-state

### 2. Exchange the code from the redirect (…/?code=…&state=demo-state)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "<code from the redirect>", "redirectUri": "http://localhost:8765/"}

### 3. The logged-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 4. New tokens (the refresh token is rotated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"}

### 5. Log out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"}
